1
00:00:00,121 --> 00:00:01,691
(panting)

2
00:00:01,690 --> 00:00:03,560
(Raj:)How you feeling?

3
00:00:03,558 --> 00:00:05,028
(Penny:)Good.

4
00:00:05,026 --> 00:00:07,896
(Sheldon:)Little claustrophobic.

5
00:00:07,896 --> 00:00:09,296
(Raj:)Let's set up
the equipment.

6
00:00:09,297 --> 00:00:11,567
(Raj:)It'll help take
your mind off of it.

7
00:00:11,566 --> 00:00:15,666
(Sheldon:)Miners often sang mining songs
to keep their spirits up.

8
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,340
(Raj:)Do you know any
mining songs?

9
00:00:17,339 --> 00:00:19,469
(Sheldon:)Just the hits.

10
00:00:19,474 --> 00:00:23,144
♪ Where it's dark
as a dungeon ♪

11
00:00:23,144 --> 00:00:25,474
♪ And it's damp
as the dew ♪

12
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:26,610
(Rajj:)That's pretty.

13
00:00:26,615 --> 00:00:28,945
♪ Where the dangers
are double ♪

14
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:32,050
♪ And the pleasures
are few ♪

15
00:00:32,053 --> 00:00:34,853
♪ Where the rain never falls ♪

16
00:00:34,856 --> 00:00:37,526
♪ And the sun never shines ♪

17
00:00:37,525 --> 00:00:40,465
♪ Yes, it's dark as a dungeon ♪

18
00:00:40,462 --> 00:00:42,462
♪ Way down
in the mine ♪

19
00:00:42,464 --> 00:00:44,664
(Raj:)It's a little more
bleak than I thought.

20
00:00:44,666 --> 00:00:47,236
♪ Well, I pray
when I dead ♪

21
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,035
♪ And the ages shall roll ♪

22
00:00:50,038 --> 00:00:52,768
♪ That my body will blacken ♪

23
00:00:52,774 --> 00:00:55,204
♪ And turn into coal ♪

24
00:00:55,210 --> 00:00:58,610
(Raj:)Getting kind
of grim.

